// Title: DumpMinitool Execution
// ID: dee0a7a3-f200-4112-a99b-952196d81e42
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems), Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-04-06
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1036, attack.t1003.001, attack.credential-access
// Description: Detects the use of "DumpMinitool.exe" a tool that allows the dump of process memory via the use of the "MiniDumpWriteDump"
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " Full") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " Mini") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " WithHeap"))) AND (((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\DumpMinitool.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\DumpMinitool.x86.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\DumpMinitool.arm64.exe"))) OR ((where(OriginalFileName = "DumpMinitool.exe") OR where(OriginalFileName = "DumpMinitool.x86.exe") OR where(OriginalFileName = "DumpMinitool.arm64.exe")))))
